# Large gen16 artefacts are excluded by design and their SHA-256 is recorded in
# results/MANIFEST.sha256 (START_HERE.md section 8).  Regenerate them with the script named in
# the owning lead's report; verify with scripts/g16_manifest.py --check.
# Everything a report cites by number lives in a small committed CSV or JSON.
results/**/_*.pkl
results/**/_*.parquet
results/**/_pe_keep/
results/L4/per_extractant_by_budget.parquet
results/L3/l3c_per_task.csv
results/**/*.log
!results/**/run.log
__pycache__/

# Raw xtb working directories for the L1 Stage 2 reference species: 361 job folders, ~97 MB of
# scratch (xtb.out, xtbopt.xyz, wbo, charges).  Fully regenerable in ~5 minutes from the committed
# inputs with scripts/l1_run_references_local.py --workers 6.  The scientific result,
# reference_energies.csv, IS committed, and results/L1/reference_species/sha256_out.txt records a
# digest of every xtb.out so a regenerated run can be compared with the one the report used.
results/L1/reference_species/out/
